{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3436","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3436","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3436\",\"parent_revision\":\"899d9e69918570c0b29c9c4daf68818734b8522c4d9798105c5c362434193cce\",\"root_revision\":\"899d9e69918570c0b29c9c4daf68818734b8522c4d9798105c5c362434193cce\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-09-06\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\n55 distinct skills are cited bare as /name rather than /namespace:name, against the convention recorded in .claude/CLAUDE.md. Two of those names are provided by more than one plugin, so the reference resolves unpredictably.\\n\\nAMBIGUOUS\\n\\n- /lint is provided by holistic-linting, plugin-creator and python-engineering.\\n- /skill-creator is provided by plugin-creator and by a bare skill-creator skill.\\n\\nWhich one an agent gets depends on what is installed and in what order, so the same instruction routes to a different tool in different environments. For /lint the three candidates do materially different jobs, so a misroute is not a near-miss.\\n\\nHIGHEST-VOLUME BARE REFERENCES\\n\\n/work-backlog-item (38), /complete-implementation (21), /work-milestone (14), /groom-milestone (11), /refactor-skill (10). All resolve today because their names happen to be unique.\\n\\nIMPACT\\n\\nThe two ambiguous names are a correctness problem now. The other 53 are a latent one: each becomes ambiguous the moment any other installed plugin ships a skill of the same name, and nothing detects that collision when it happens.\\n\\nUser-provided context: a re-runnable scanner from the audit can produce the full list. A drift test that fails when any bare reference becomes ambiguous would turn the latent case into a caught one; whether that belongs in this item or its own is a grooming decision.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Repo-wide skill reference audit, 2026-09-06\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-06\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"c096d4dcbd3483fd82abd68a8be59f40e6f23c7376cbc3e143df30b90752754a\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABTSA3tg\"}"}